steps.body:
Write `move_to_front(songs, title)`, which returns a new list with the first occurrence of `title` moved to the front;
if it isn't there, a copy of the list. It must not change `songs`. Then write `add_unique(songs, title)`, which
changes `songs` itself, appending `title` only if it isn't already there, and returns nothing.

